		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — When you'd drop to 0 HP, drop to 1 instead and shock the area.</em></p><p><strong>1/Safe Rest · Free Reaction.</strong> When you would drop to 0 HP, you instead drop to 1, then Burst 1, Damage: LVL Lightning and gain Charged. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Restore: INT+LVL HP.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Max Wounds increase by 1.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the AED gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"AED (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] The 1/Safe Rest use is a counter on this feature, tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Passive: Max Wounds +1.</em></p>",
